t 27:22 ; Num 6:7 ; 2Sam 13:1-2 , 4 +, Song 8:8 (twice in verse); called upon, in mourning for dead Jer 22:18 ; = near relative Gen 24:59-60 , (or because Laban prominent ? so Di); /man of same nationality Num 25:18 compare Hosea 2:3 . 2 = beloved Song 4:9-10 , 12 ; 5:12 (4 t. || כַּלָּה bride ; phrase originally implying that marriage with half-sister — of same father — was allowed? compare Nö ZMG 1886 , 150 & Gen 20:12 ). 3 symbolic of Judah, Samaria, Sodom & Jerusalem Jer 3:7-8 , 10 ; Ezek 16:45 , 52 (twice in verse) (strike out Co) +, 23:4 , 11 +. 4 figurative of intimate connection לָרִמָּה וַאֲחֹתִי אִמִּי ֗֗֗ קָרָאתִי Job 17:14 ; אַתְּ אֲחֹתִי לַחָכְמָה אֱמֹר Prov 7:4 . 5 . another , אֶלאֲֿחֹתָהּ אִשָּׁה , of curtains of tabernacle Exod 26:3 (twice in verse); 26:6 ; loops 26:5 , tenons 26:17 ; of wings of living creatures, Ezekiel's vision Ezek 1:9 , 23 ; 3:13 ; not of persons, but see רְעוּת .","rootNote":"irregular feminine of 251 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 1 39","keyReferences":["1Chr 1 39","1Chr 2 16","1Chr 2 16","1Chr 3 9","1Chr 3 19","1Chr 4 3","1Chr 4 19","1Chr 7 15"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":119,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 1 39","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":39,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/אֲח֥וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 2 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"ו/אחיתי/הם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfpc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 2 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":2,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/אַחְיוֹתֵי/הֶ֖ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfpc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 3 9","book":"1Chr","chapter":3,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֲחוֹתָֽ/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"1Chr 3 19","book":"1Chr","chapter":3,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֲחוֹתָֽ/ם","source":"hebrew","mor